{"id":"9cbbb9f968fe8087","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-strongly-convergent.md","title":"每个极限阶段的强收敛","display":"df-strongly-convergent — 每个极限阶段的强收敛","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","depends_on":["[[56-df-infinitary-rewrite-step]]","[[56-df-metric-on-terms]]"],"label":"56-df-strongly-convergent","aliases":["56-df-strongly-convergent"],"display":"df-strongly-convergent — 每个极限阶段的强收敛","type":"definition","source_reference":"Terese (2003), Definition 12.3.1, printed pp672–673","source_ocr_block":"693–694","source_status":"statement-compared-to-local-djvu-ocr"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4e0030b331726af9\" href=\"?note=4e0030b331726af9\" title=\"56-df-infinitary-rewrite-step\">56-df-infinitary-rewrite-step</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"abe5105dc83b1e79\" href=\"?note=abe5105dc83b1e79\" title=\"56-df-metric-on-terms\">56-df-metric-on-terms</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-strongly-convergent"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-strongly-convergent</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-strongly-convergent — 每个极限阶段的强收敛"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Terese (2003), Definition 12.3.1, printed pp672–673"},{"key":"source_ocr_block","html":"693–694"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-to-local-djvu-ocr"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>给定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{iTRS}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{iTRS}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V,R)\\)</span>、项树度量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> 是序数类，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\alpha,\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha+1\">\\(\\alpha+1\\)</span> 是序数后继，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\gamma,\\lambda)=\\{\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}:\\gamma\\le\\beta&lt;\\lambda\\}\">\\([\\gamma,\\lambda)=\\{\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}:\\gamma\\le\\beta&lt;\\lambda\\}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in T^\\infty\">\\(s,t\\in T^\\infty\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf t\\in(T^\\infty)^{\\alpha+1}\">\\(\\mathbf t\\in(T^\\infty)^{\\alpha+1}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf p\\in W^\\alpha\">\\(\\mathbf p\\in W^\\alpha\\)</span>，并记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t_\\beta=\\mathbf t(\\beta)\">\\(t_\\beta=\\mathbf t(\\beta)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_\\beta=\\mathbf p(\\beta)\">\\(p_\\beta=\\mathbf p(\\beta)\\)</span>。序数量词在集合论元语言中解释。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Lim}(\\lambda)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\lambda\\ne0\\land\\forall\\gamma&lt;\\lambda\\;(\\gamma+1\\ne\\lambda).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Lim}(\\lambda)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\lambda\\ne0\\land\\forall\\gamma&lt;\\lambda\\;(\\gamma+1\\ne\\lambda).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Reduction}_R(\\mathbf t,\\mathbf p,\\alpha)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\beta&lt;\\alpha\\;\\mathrm{Step}_R(t_\\beta,p_\\beta,t_{\\beta+1}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Reduction}_R(\\mathbf t,\\mathbf p,\\alpha)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\beta&lt;\\alpha\\;\\mathrm{Step}_R(t_\\beta,p_\\beta,t_{\\beta+1}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WeakConv}_R(\\mathbf t,\\mathbf p,\\alpha)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Reduction}_R(\\mathbf t,\\mathbf p,\\alpha)\\land\n\\forall\\lambda\\le\\alpha\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Lim}(\\lambda)\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\gamma&lt;\\lambda\\;\n\\forall\\beta\\in[\\gamma,\\lambda)\\;(d(t_\\beta,t_\\lambda)&lt;\\varepsilon)\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{WeakConv}_R(\\mathbf t,\\mathbf p,\\alpha)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Reduction}_R(\\mathbf t,\\mathbf p,\\alpha)\\land\n\\forall\\lambda\\le\\alpha\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Lim}(\\lambda)\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\gamma&lt;\\lambda\\;\n\\forall\\beta\\in[\\gamma,\\lambda)\\;(d(t_\\beta,t_\\lambda)&lt;\\varepsilon)\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StrongConv}_R(\\mathbf t,\\mathbf p,\\alpha)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{WeakConv}_R(\\mathbf t,\\mathbf p,\\alpha)\\land\n\\forall\\lambda\\le\\alpha\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Lim}(\\lambda)\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\gamma&lt;\\lambda\\;\n\\forall\\beta\\in[\\gamma,\\lambda)\\;(|p_\\beta|&gt;k)\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{StrongConv}_R(\\mathbf t,\\mathbf p,\\alpha)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{WeakConv}_R(\\mathbf t,\\mathbf p,\\alpha)\\land\n\\forall\\lambda\\le\\alpha\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Lim}(\\lambda)\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\gamma&lt;\\lambda\\;\n\\forall\\beta\\in[\\gamma,\\lambda)\\;(|p_\\beta|&gt;k)\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Reach}_R^\\alpha(s,t)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathbf u\\in(T^\\infty)^{\\alpha+1}\\;\n\\exists\\mathbf q\\in W^\\alpha\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{StrongConv}_R(\\mathbf u,\\mathbf q,\\alpha)\n\\land\\mathbf u(0)=s\\land\\mathbf u(\\alpha)=t\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Reach}_R^\\alpha(s,t)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathbf u\\in(T^\\infty)^{\\alpha+1}\\;\n\\exists\\mathbf q\\in W^\\alpha\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{StrongConv}_R(\\mathbf u,\\mathbf q,\\alpha)\n\\land\\mathbf u(0)=s\\land\\mathbf u(\\alpha)=t\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s\\twoheadrightarrow_R^\\infty t\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;\\mathrm{Reach}_R^\\alpha(s,t).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s\\twoheadrightarrow_R^\\infty t\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;\\mathrm{Reach}_R^\\alpha(s,t).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Definition 12.3.1（印刷 pp672–673，OCR 页块693–694）。必须在每个非零极限序数（包括终点若它是极限）检查度量收敛和归约深度趋于无穷。长度是步数序数，故项序列含终点而位置序列不含终点。有限归约没有非零极限阶段，自动强收敛。旧文仅给终点 Cauchy 条件且没有实际归约步约束，现均已补齐。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-infinitary-rewrite-step","status":"resolved","id":"4e0030b331726af9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-infinitary-rewrite-step]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-metric-on-terms","status":"resolved","id":"abe5105dc83b1e79","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-metric-on-terms]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{iTRS}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V,R)","display":false},{"tex":"d","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha,\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha+1","display":false},{"tex":"[\\gamma,\\lambda)=\\{\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}:\\gamma\\le\\beta<\\lambda\\}","display":false},{"tex":"s,t\\in T^\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf t\\in(T^\\infty)^{\\alpha+1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf p\\in W^\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"t_\\beta=\\mathbf t(\\beta)","display":false},{"tex":"p_\\beta=\\mathbf p(\\beta)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Lim}(\\lambda)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\lambda\\ne0\\land\\forall\\gamma<\\lambda\\;(\\gamma+1\\ne\\lambda).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Reduction}_R(\\mathbf t,\\mathbf p,\\alpha)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\beta<\\alpha\\;\\mathrm{Step}_R(t_\\beta,p_\\beta,t_{\\beta+1}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WeakConv}_R(\\mathbf t,\\mathbf p,\\alpha)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Reduction}_R(\\mathbf t,\\mathbf p,\\alpha)\\land\n\\forall\\lambda\\le\\alpha\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Lim}(\\lambda)\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\exists\\gamma<\\lambda\\;\n\\forall\\beta\\in[\\gamma,\\lambda)\\;(d(t_\\beta,t_\\lambda)<\\varepsilon)\\Bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StrongConv}_R(\\mathbf t,\\mathbf p,\\alpha)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{WeakConv}_R(\\mathbf t,\\mathbf p,\\alpha)\\land\n\\forall\\lambda\\le\\alpha\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Lim}(\\lambda)\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\gamma<\\lambda\\;\n\\forall\\beta\\in[\\gamma,\\lambda)\\;(|p_\\beta|>k)\\Bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Reach}_R^\\alpha(s,t)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathbf u\\in(T^\\infty)^{\\alpha+1}\\;\n\\exists\\mathbf q\\in W^\\alpha\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{StrongConv}_R(\\mathbf u,\\mathbf q,\\alpha)\n\\land\\mathbf u(0)=s\\land\\mathbf u(\\alpha)=t\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"s\\twoheadrightarrow_R^\\infty t\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;\\mathrm{Reach}_R^\\alpha(s,t).","display":true}],"bytes":2627,"backlinks":[{"id":"15a2e6c82927d21a","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"取互异函数符号 $A,C$，$\\Sigma=(\\{A,C\\},\\{(A,1),(C,1)\\})$；$\\mathcal V$ 为与它们不交的变量集，$x,y\\in\\mathcal V$ 且 $x\\ne y$。使用 [[56-df-infinitary-rewrite-step]] 的位置树编码、$\\mathrm{Step}_R$ 和 [[56-df-strongly-convergent]] 的序列谓词。$\\epsilon=()$，$\\cdot$ 为位置串连接，$n\\in\\mathbb N$；$w_n$ 按自然数递归。"},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-310","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-strongly-convergent.md]]"},{"id":"6a84716b352ca212","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"给定 $\\mathrm{iTRS}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V,R)$，并假定每个左部是有限且左线性的树：$\\forall(l,r)\\in R\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathcal V\\;|\\{p\\in\\mathrm{dom}(l):l(p)=x\\}|\\le1$。$s,t\\in T^\\infty$，$\\alpha$ 是序数；$\\mathrm{Reach}_R^\\alpha$ 见 [[56-df-strongly-convergent]]，仅表示强收敛归约。"},{"id":"b868c3cedde4d2f8","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"给定 $\\mathrm{StrongConv}_R(\\mathbf t,\\mathbf p,\\alpha)$，见 [[56-df-strongly-convergent]]。$\\alpha$ 为步数序数，$p_\\beta$ 为每一步归约位置。$\\aleph_0$ 表示可数无限基数。"}],"outgoing":["4e0030b331726af9","abe5105dc83b1e79"]}